    "https://www.careeronestop.org/Toolkit/Jobs/match-veteran-jobs.aspx": {
      "title": "Veterans Job Matcher",
      "description": "Veterans Job Matcher | Jobs| CareerOneStop Survey dialog x The survey is available in English only. Skip to main content your source for career exploration, training & jobs Sponsored by the U.S. Department of Labor. A proud partner of the network. Menu Login My profile Saved pages More resources Logout Translate Search by Keyword Explore Careers Find Training Job Search Find Local Help Toolkit Resources For Search by Keyword Veterans Job Matcher Saved Veterans Job Matcher Want to put your military skills to work in a civilian job? Enter your military job to find related civilian careers. You'll find career information and links to job postings in your local area. Military Occupation Search Your military occupation Your branch All branches Air Force Army Coast Guard Marines Navy Search Sort by Best Match Pay Grade: High to Low Pay Grade: Low to High Occupation: A to Z Occupation: Z to A Wages: High to Low Wages: Low to High Education: High to Low Education: Low to High Outlook: High to Low Outlook: Low to High 0 Typical Pay Grade Civilian Occupation Typical Wages Typical Education Outlook Job Postings 10 25 50 100 500 Per Page Download Select the type of the download. Select the type of the download. Excel PDF Word RTF Download file Close Please choose the type of download. New Search Your Search Your Search Your military occupation Your branch All branches Air Force Army Coast Guard Marines Navy Search Filter By Typical Pay Grade (Undo) More Typical Education (Undo) More Outlook (Undo) More Use the Veterans Job Matcher to find civilian careers that might be a good match for your military skills. You’ll get information on matching occupations including wages, education, outlook, and a link to current local job postings. Help Back to top Explore & Find Explore Careers Find Training Job Search Find Local Help Toolkit Resources For ... Video Library How-to Guides Our Sites CareerOneStop Competency Model Clearinghouse GetMyFuture Justice-Impacted mySkills myFuture Veterans Help FAQs Data Sources Cite this Website Need to Register? For Developers Link to Us Data Downloads Web API Widgets and Logos News Center CareerOneStop News Outreach Materials User Accounts About User Accounts Login Connect For information about jobs, training, career resources, or unemployment benefits call: 1-877-US2-JOBS\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t(1-877-872-5627)\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tor TTY\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t1-877-889-5627 For help using the CareerOneStop website: info@careeronestop.org CareerOneStop is sponsored by the U.S. Department of Labor, Employment and Training Administration A proud partner of the network. About Us Site Map Contact Us Site Privacy Accessibility Partner Sites Copyright © 2026 State of Minnesota /JS/5e7d01b1.js?v=08252026 6LdDIyAcAAAAAC94osFjA_jAWGJ-Wdhvy8ndlDMb Kes5NJzLDIsZ2Iz2c4t2s3tk3VSZ5M8DSn7PNfcmXdE= EntryPage"
    },
